WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:47.152
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:47.422 --> 00:49.424
Don’t worry, my love.

3
00:49.507 --> 00:51.801
I’ll take care of the children.

4
00:52.802 --> 00:54.262
Rest now, my love.

5
00:54.345 --> 00:56.514
We’ll see each other again. Just wait for me.

6
00:56.598 --> 00:57.432
Oh, Mom.

7
00:57.515 --> 00:59.559
To the father of all of you.

8
01:05.565 --> 01:08.068
Viktor and Donabel escaped!

9
01:08.151 --> 01:10.320
That’s not even the bad news, yet.

10
01:12.113 --> 01:14.657
We have reason to believe

11
01:14.741 --> 01:17.869
that they’ve already left the country.

12
01:18.578 --> 01:19.746
What?

13
01:22.457 --> 01:24.292
You’re making the wrong decision.

14
01:24.375 --> 01:26.336
Didn’t you two already plan a life together?

15
01:26.419 --> 01:27.253
What happened?

16
01:27.337 --> 01:31.633
We all know there’s really no future for Mikoy and me.

17
01:31.716 --> 01:34.427
I can’t escape who I really am.

18
01:48.483 --> 01:50.110
NORBERTO S. RUIZ GENERAL

19
01:59.202 --> 02:00.078
Mikoy.

20
02:01.996 --> 02:02.956
Mikoy.

21
02:05.083 --> 02:07.127
Mikoy, where are you going?

22
02:09.838 --> 02:10.964
If I'm not mistaken,

23
02:11.548 --> 02:13.967
I am no longer a police asset of this agency.

24
02:17.595 --> 02:19.597
You don't get to run my life anymore.

25
02:22.559 --> 02:24.352
I understand what you're feeling.

26
02:27.188 --> 02:28.064
Really?

27
02:30.984 --> 02:32.360
You have no idea

28
02:33.528 --> 02:34.988
what I'm going through.

29
02:40.326 --> 02:43.538
Stop acting like you're the only one who lost someone they loved.

30
02:44.372 --> 02:45.915
You're not the only one who's hurting.

31
02:47.750 --> 02:50.336
You're not the only one who lost a family member.

32
02:51.963 --> 02:54.382
And you're not the only one who became a victim of injustice.

33
02:57.802 --> 02:59.470
Look at what I did with myself.

34
03:02.348 --> 03:03.641
I didn't wallow in self-pity.

35
03:05.393 --> 03:07.478
I didn't let my anger consume me.

36
03:08.354 --> 03:09.981
I entered the system,

37
03:11.107 --> 03:13.151
and I tried to make the system work,

38
03:13.234 --> 03:15.486
so I could get the justice I was looking for.

39
03:17.572 --> 03:18.698
Did you get it?

40
03:21.451 --> 03:23.745
Did you get justice for your father?

41
03:25.663 --> 03:27.373
Did you find the person who killed him?

42
03:27.957 --> 03:33.004
Did you make the people who did this to you and your family pay?

43
03:39.469 --> 03:40.386
You're right.

44
03:41.846 --> 03:42.764
I didn’t.

45
03:45.975 --> 03:47.602
But every day that I do this,

46
03:47.685 --> 03:48.895
I pray for just one thing.

47
03:49.395 --> 03:51.814
That no one else gets dragged into this,

48
03:51.898 --> 03:53.942
that no one else has to experience

49
03:54.025 --> 03:56.444
the injustice that I experienced.

50
03:59.864 --> 04:01.824
And I promised myself, Mikoy,

51
04:03.409 --> 04:06.621
that I would never ever take the law into my own hands.

52
04:07.956 --> 04:09.707
Because that's not true justice.

53
04:11.376 --> 04:13.419
It only spreads the same violence even further,

54
04:13.503 --> 04:15.672
the very violence that victimized my father and my family.

55
04:18.466 --> 04:19.509
So please, Mikoy,

56
04:19.592 --> 04:22.345
don't do something you'll regret in the end.

57
04:23.680 --> 04:24.847
Yes, you're right.

58
04:26.140 --> 04:28.518
Let's get justice for Dad Mario's death.

59
04:30.103 --> 04:31.688
But let's do it the right way.

60
04:34.274 --> 04:35.650
Because I'm sure

61
04:37.777 --> 04:39.279
that's what he would want too.

62
05:00.300 --> 05:04.012
Our top priority is figuring out how to control the Concordat.

63
05:05.305 --> 05:08.516
Yes, a lot of them have switched sides and are supporting us,

64
05:08.599 --> 05:11.269
but there are still many who are fighting back.

65
05:11.352 --> 05:13.938
Especially Rio de Janyx's faction.

66
05:23.948 --> 05:24.949
What are you going to do?

67
05:25.575 --> 05:27.702
I'm going back to the Philippines for now.

68
05:27.785 --> 05:31.372
To make sure Rahmboy has cleaned up everything.

69
05:35.251 --> 05:37.712
Don't tell me you're going to miss me.

70
05:41.549 --> 05:44.802
There's just one more obstacle to my leadership of the Concordat.

71
05:45.845 --> 05:46.804
Who?

72
06:22.965 --> 06:24.050
Move over.

73
06:24.133 --> 06:25.468
Relax. Come on, come on.

74
06:25.551 --> 06:27.470
Relax. We're not the enemy.

75
06:28.262 --> 06:31.933
If you're not the enemy, why are you following me?

76
06:32.016 --> 06:33.184
What do you want?

77
06:33.267 --> 06:34.811
Just a second.

78
06:34.894 --> 06:36.104
I'm just getting my wallet.

79
06:36.187 --> 06:37.313
I'm just getting my wallet.

80
06:37.396 --> 06:38.606
Here, here.

81
06:45.446 --> 06:47.740
BUREAU OF INTELLIGENCE AND BLACK OPERATIONS

82
06:48.449 --> 06:49.367
BIBO?

83
06:58.084 --> 07:01.796
I think we're the ones who can help with your problem.

84
07:03.047 --> 07:04.298
Hey, not too fast.

85
07:06.342 --> 07:07.552
What do you mean?

86
07:10.471 --> 07:13.391
If you really want to get justice for your father's death,

87
07:14.434 --> 07:15.601
call me.

88
07:22.567 --> 07:23.734
We're the agency

89
07:23.818 --> 07:25.778
that operates in the shadows.

90
07:27.405 --> 07:28.739
We're also the agency

91
07:29.740 --> 07:31.784
that can bend the rules.

92
08:00.104 --> 08:01.147
Where are you?

93
08:17.997 --> 08:20.458
So you'd better tell me where you are.

94
08:30.426 --> 08:33.638
And another thing, you are not a queen.

95
08:55.076 --> 08:57.453
So you think we’re still redeemable, huh?

96
08:58.371 --> 09:01.499
Between the two of us, I thought I was the naive one.

97
09:02.458 --> 09:04.293
But I guess I was wrong.

98
09:15.555 --> 09:17.265
And the more you hide,

99
09:17.807 --> 09:19.433
the more reason you give me to believe

100
09:19.517 --> 09:21.227
that you're not on my side.

101
09:29.902 --> 09:32.947
Donatello, you won't beat me.

102
09:37.868 --> 09:39.579
So here's your only choice.

103
09:40.162 --> 09:44.000
Family, sibling, or whatever you want to call it.

104
09:48.588 --> 09:51.007
Or I'll hunt you down myself.

105
10:04.478 --> 10:07.440
It can't be that I'm the only one who's heartbroken in this story.

106
10:29.378 --> 10:30.713
I'm on my way back.

107
10:30.796 --> 10:32.965
Okay, we have a big problem.

108
10:33.049 --> 10:34.342
What kind of problem?

109
10:55.029 --> 10:57.990
If you really want to get justice for your father's death,

110
10:58.074 --> 10:59.367
call me.

111
11:00.326 --> 11:03.204
We're the agency that can operate in the shadows.

112
11:03.996 --> 11:07.083
We're also the agency that can bend the rules.

113
11:26.727 --> 11:27.603
Mikoy?

114
11:45.579 --> 11:47.873
Mikoy and I are getting married.

115
11:49.875 --> 11:52.086
Looks like you learned a lot from Chiara.

116
12:02.388 --> 12:03.639
Do you know all of this?

117
12:18.696 --> 12:20.948
If there's one thing impressive about you,

118
12:21.574 --> 12:23.075
it's your loyalty to her.

119
12:27.413 --> 12:29.665
No one can stop me.

120
12:29.748 --> 12:32.751
Until I get justice for my father's death.

121
12:32.835 --> 12:36.422
I don't care if all of you and your minions join forces.

122
12:37.047 --> 12:39.008
Because I'll wipe you all out.

123
12:39.550 --> 12:42.052
Until people like you no longer exist in this world.

124
12:52.730 --> 12:55.900
If you're going to kill me, Chiara, or anyone else,

125
12:55.983 --> 12:59.445
it won't make the pain you're feeling go away.

126
13:02.031 --> 13:04.742
Before you go down this path, my friend,

127
13:05.659 --> 13:07.495
is this really what you want?

128
13:19.965 --> 13:21.884
The day she killed my father.

129
14:41.672 --> 14:43.007
Hello, Mom?

130
14:43.090 --> 14:44.258
Hello, son, Mikoy.

131
14:44.341 --> 14:45.926
Where are you?

132
14:46.010 --> 14:47.428
Don't you have work?

133
14:48.888 --> 14:51.765
I do, Mom. I'm here in Manila.

134
14:51.849 --> 14:52.808
What?

135
14:53.350 --> 14:55.394
What are you doing there?

136
14:55.477 --> 14:57.187
Is this because of your father?

137
14:58.272 --> 14:59.481
No, Mom.

138
15:00.566 --> 15:02.109
This isn't about Dad.

139
15:02.192 --> 15:03.027
Oh.

140
15:03.110 --> 15:05.863
If not, why are you there without telling me?

141
15:06.572 --> 15:09.116
Are you craving floods, son?

142
15:09.199 --> 15:12.244
Pothole-filled roads and pollution?

143
15:12.328 --> 15:13.954
Is that what you're looking for?

144
15:14.622 --> 15:15.831
Come on, Mom.

145
15:15.915 --> 15:18.375
Not all the roads here are full of potholes.

146
15:18.459 --> 15:21.420
Besides, they're just a little bumpy.

147
15:21.503 --> 15:24.381
And it's not exactly pollution.

148
15:24.465 --> 15:26.175
Can't it just be foggy, Mom?

149
15:27.217 --> 15:29.178
Oh, you.

150
15:29.261 --> 15:32.014
It's the same thing. You just said it differently.

151
15:32.640 --> 15:34.767
Don't try to dodge the question.

152
15:34.850 --> 15:35.976
Why are you there?

153
15:36.894 --> 15:38.812
I just had to take care of something

154
15:39.730 --> 15:42.066
as a tourism officer in Albay.

155
15:42.149 --> 15:45.235
I'm joining a…

156
15:45.319 --> 15:46.654
travel expo next month.

157
15:46.737 --> 15:49.198
I'm just going to showcase the beauty of Albay.

158
15:49.281 --> 15:52.284
We can't be the only ones who get to see how beautiful it is, right?

159
15:53.786 --> 15:54.787
Mom.

160
15:56.413 --> 15:57.581
Please believe me.

161
15:57.665 --> 15:59.583
I'm really okay.

162
16:00.084 --> 16:03.796
And yes, I really am working here.

163
16:05.172 --> 16:06.256
Okay, Mom?

164
16:39.665 --> 16:41.000
What do you mean?

165
16:41.083 --> 16:43.335
Just yesterday, he got connected with BIBO.

166
16:44.211 --> 16:45.963
Who are these BIBOs?

167
16:52.928 --> 16:54.722
Their M.O. is simple.

168
16:58.183 --> 17:02.771
And they operate off the record and unofficially for the government.

169
17:03.647 --> 17:06.066
Because with so many bad people, criminals,

170
17:06.150 --> 17:08.152
the law can't keep up with all of them.

171
17:08.235 --> 17:10.863
So because of their power and protection,

172
17:10.946 --> 17:12.114
this group was formed.

173
17:20.164 --> 17:21.498
I'm just worried and afraid

174
17:21.582 --> 17:23.959
that if they manage to get Mikoy on their side,

175
17:24.543 --> 17:26.295
Chiara won't be the only one in danger,

176
17:26.378 --> 17:28.130
you won't be the only one in danger,

177
17:28.213 --> 17:31.091
the whole squad will be in danger.

178
17:31.675 --> 17:36.263
Chiara specifically instructed us not to make a move against Mikoy.

179
17:36.764 --> 17:38.932
If anything happens to Mikoy,

180
17:39.016 --> 17:41.018
we'll be the ones who take the hit.

181
17:43.312 --> 17:47.483
Unless you can make it look like an accident.

182
18:07.586 --> 18:11.840
I don’t care if it’s not fine or if it’s wrong.

183
18:11.924 --> 18:13.759
All I know is that

184
18:14.426 --> 18:16.178
I love you so much.

185
18:17.221 --> 18:18.597
And it doesn’t matter

186
18:19.223 --> 18:20.974
if the whole world is angry at you.

187
18:21.517 --> 18:23.894
I will face them all for you.

188
18:54.758 --> 18:55.592
Seriously?

189
18:56.218 --> 18:57.803
La Fornarina?

190
19:02.099 --> 19:03.767
Asking someone to open a water bottle?

191
19:08.188 --> 19:11.233
Even if I'm the infamous La Fornarina,

192
19:11.316 --> 19:12.151
the deadliest,

193
19:12.234 --> 19:14.736
most powerful assassin in the world,

194
19:14.820 --> 19:16.446
I'm still a woman,

195
19:16.530 --> 19:18.448
standing in front of a boy,

196
19:18.532 --> 19:21.368
asking him to open my water bottle!

197
19:21.451 --> 19:22.744
Or I will snap your neck

198
19:22.828 --> 19:25.372
and send you to an early grave!

199
19:26.331 --> 19:27.916
Okay, okay. Here, here.

200
19:28.000 --> 19:28.959
I'm opening it.

201
19:29.793 --> 19:31.628
Come on, sweetheart. Don't threaten me.

202
19:31.712 --> 19:32.838
See? It's that easy.

203
19:32.921 --> 19:34.631
-Exactly. -Thank you, sweetheart.

204
19:36.800 --> 19:38.010
Let me have a little.

205
20:02.159 --> 20:04.870
I hope you're doing well.

206
20:09.583 --> 20:13.378
I hope you're eating properly, my love.

207
20:17.758 --> 20:19.092
And I hope

208
20:20.552 --> 20:23.305
you don't let your anger consume you too much.

209
20:55.963 --> 20:57.297
Yes, yes.

210
21:20.404 --> 21:22.614
Just finish your breakfast, you two.

211
21:23.198 --> 21:26.326
No, Cocoy and Carlota, you're still new to the force, so you don't know.

212
21:27.244 --> 21:28.412
But this is Janggo,

213
21:28.495 --> 21:32.207
from the Bureau of Intelligence and Black Operations, or BIBO

214
21:32.874 --> 21:35.210
Those people who work in the shadows.

215
21:41.383 --> 21:44.303
All we offer is an additional tool for the government

216
21:44.386 --> 21:47.764
for dealing with criminals who have escaped our justice system.

217
21:48.557 --> 21:51.893
We don't neutralize people just for the sake of neutralizing them.

218
21:51.977 --> 21:55.314
We only do this when it's necessary to make them pay for their crimes,

219
21:55.397 --> 21:57.524
and to make sure they can't hurt anyone again.

220
22:00.277 --> 22:03.947
Is that what you tell yourself to justify killings?

221
22:28.055 --> 22:30.265
To get the justice I've been looking for?

222
22:43.320 --> 22:45.489
Now it's up to you and the entire agency

223
22:45.572 --> 22:47.240
whether you want to be part of this decision.

224
22:51.703 --> 22:53.371
She already victimized my father.

225
22:53.455 --> 22:55.832
And I won't let that happen to anyone else.

226
23:07.594 --> 23:10.680
Even we are tired of this slow justice.

227
23:22.317 --> 23:23.610
A true brother.

228
23:32.702 --> 23:34.412
But in our world,

229
23:35.080 --> 23:38.792
BIBO is a legitimate agency,

230
23:38.875 --> 23:40.418
and they are legal.

231
24:16.163 --> 24:17.998
From this moment on,

232
24:31.094 --> 24:33.972
When Chiara took her seat as the Queen of the Concordat,

233
24:34.055 --> 24:36.141
the organization regained its strength.

234
24:36.224 --> 24:38.310
All of their operations are in Europe.

235
24:38.393 --> 24:40.228
But sooner or later, they will reach the Philippines too.

236
24:40.312 --> 24:41.605
And to prevent that from happening,

237
24:41.688 --> 24:43.148
we have to neutralize Chiara.

238
24:46.651 --> 24:48.153
Your mother respects you.

239
24:48.236 --> 24:51.364
But that doesn’t mean I will extend that same courtesy to you.

240
24:53.241 --> 24:54.409
What makes you say that?

241
24:54.492 --> 24:57.954
Because Bro Mikoy has one thing that you don’t.

242
24:58.038 --> 24:58.872
And what is that?

243
24:58.955 --> 25:00.749
He has a reason to live.

244
25:04.085 --> 25:05.086
Mikoy.

245
25:05.879 --> 25:07.297
We have new information.
